trace.request:
Perform comprehensive physical examination including:  
- Palpation of the entire thyroid gland for size (normal/enlarged), symmetry, tenderness, and presence of additional nodules;  
- Assessment for bilateral cervical, supraclavicular, and axillary lymphadenopathy;  
- Inspection and bimanual palpation of the oral cavity, oropharynx, and base of tongue;  
- Auscultation of the thyroid for bruit (already reported as absent, but confirm).

